at Nelson Mandela's Birthday Show", "url": "https://www.foxnews.com/story/singer-amy-winehouse-takes-the-stage-at-nelson-mandelas-birthday-show.amp"}, {"title": "Amy Winehouse", "url": "https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Amy_Winehouse"}]}, "The premise checks out: Winehouse performed at the Hyde Park concert for Mandela's 90th birthday in 2008, and \"Rehab\" was a Grammy winner that year. The sources differ on which Grammy categories \"Rehab\" won, though.\n\n- **Concert:** Winehouse performed at Nelson Mandela's 90th Birthday Party concert at London's Hyde Park on 27 June 2008, and the next day at the Glastonbury Festival. The event was run by the 46664 charity, and she performed her Grammy Award-winning \"Rehab\" and \"Valerie.\" One report says she had spent time in the hospital in recent weeks before the show, and another says she was released from a hospital earlier this week after being diagnosed with early stages of emphysema.\n- **Grammys:** Sources agree she won at the February 2008 ceremony, but not on the categories. One says she became the first British female to win 5 Grammy Awards on the same night, with Record of the Year for \"Rehab\" among them. Another lists Record of the Year, Song of the Year, and Best Female Pop Vocal Performance at the 2008 Grammy Awards. The Song of the Year claim rests on that single source, so I'd treat it as unconfirmed without a Recording Academy check."], "durationSeconds": 8.389912167, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01RikMEGz5MTeSco9CReoues", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
